"""
data.py
-------
Static content for SkillPath AI: the skills database, topic/role catalogs,
module structure, curated video library, and the leveled quiz bank.

VIDEO_DB layout (updated):
    VIDEO_DB[topic][difficulty] = {
        "intro":   [1 video]      -- introduction video for this module
        "core":    [>=2 videos]   -- detailed/core content videos (the
                                      "at least 2 detailed videos, excluding
                                      intro/conclusion" requirement)
        "summary": [1 video]      -- final-review / recap video
    }
    Videos are watched strictly in order within a module: intro before
    core, core videos in sequence, then summary — see main.py's
    `render_learning()` / video-progress session state for the gating
    logic ("next video only unlocks once the current one is marked
    watched").

QUIZ_BANK layout (updated):
    QUIZ_BANK[topic] = [ {level, q, opts, ans, explanation}, ... ]
    Exactly 15 questions per topic: 5 easy / 5 medium / 5 hard. The same
    per-topic pool is used for the intro/core/summary quiz of that topic
    (each quiz attempt draws 15 questions -- 5 of each level -- from this
    pool). See main.py's `build_quiz_for_topic()` for the selection logic,
    the one-question-at-a-time flow, the 60-second-minimum-per-question
    timer, and the no-skip enforcement.
"""

